ttp://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 text-foreground transition-all duration-300 -rotate-90 scale-0 opacity-0 absolute\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z\"></path></svg></div></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex size-target items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-danger-soft hover:text-danger-soft-foreground\" aria-label=\"Cerrar sesión\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"size-5\"><path d=\"M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4\"></path><polyline points=\"16 17 21 12 16 7\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"9\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Cerrar Sesión</span></button></div></div><main class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-md space-y-4 p-4 lg:max-w-2xl lg:px-8 lg:py-8\"><div role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl border border-warning-soft-border bg-warning-soft p-3 text-warning-soft-foreground sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\" data-testid=\"athlete-expired-banner\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-warning animate-pulse\"></span><div class=\"space-y-0.5\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-warning\">Suscripción GOZS vencida</p><p class=\"text-xs text-warning-soft-foreground\">Seguís teniendo acceso completo. Hablá con el equipo GOZS para regularizar tu cuota.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex shrink-0 gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-150 select-none touch-manipulation focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:brightness-105 active:scale-[0.98] h-[var(--button-h-sm)] px-3 text-xs min-h-11 bg-success text-success-foreground hover:bg-success/90 touch-manipulation\" data-testid=\"expired-open-chat-banner\">💬 Hablar con GOZS</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-150 select-none touch-manipulation focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer border bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 active:scale-[0.98] h-[var(--button-h-sm)] px-3 text-xs min-h-11 touch-manipulation\" data-testid=\"expired-open-details\">Ver detalle</button></div></div><dialog class=\"m-auto w-[min(32rem,calc(100vw-2rem))] rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-0 text-foreground shadow-2xl backdrop:bg-black/60 backdrop:backdrop-blur-sm\" data-testid=\"athlete-expired-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"expired-dialog-title\" open=\"\"><div class=\"space-y-5 p-5 sm:p-6\"><div class=\"space-y-2 text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-warning-soft text-warning text-3xl\">⏳</div><h2 id=\"expired-dialog-title\" class=\"text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl\">Tu suscripción GOZS venció</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">No te preocupes: <strong>seguís entrando a la app con normalidad</strong> (entrenamiento en vivo, historial y chat). Para mantener tu plan al día, comunicate con el equipo de GOZS y coordiná la renovación.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3 rounded-xl border border-border bg-secondary/40 p-4\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Renovar es simple:</h3><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-3\"><div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Alias de Transferencia</p><p class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-primary\">GOZSTER.FIT</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-150 select-none touch-manipulation focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer border bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 active:scale-[0.98] h-[var(--button-h-sm)] px-3 text-xs text-xs\">Copiar Alias</button></div><ol class=\"list-inside list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><li>Transferí el valor de tu cuota mensual al alias de GOZS.</li><li>Enviá el comprobante al equipo por el Chat GOZS o WhatsApp.</li><li>El equipo confirma el pago y tu cuota queda al día.</li></ol></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-150 select-none touch-manipulation focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:brightness-105 active:scale-[0.98] h-[var(--button-h)] px-3.5 text-sm min-h-14 w-full bg-success text-base text-success-foreground hover:bg-success/90 active:scale-[0.99] touch-manipulation\" data-testid=\"expired-open-chat-dialog\">💬 Hablar con el equipo GOZS</button><a href=\"https://wa.me/5491155550199?text=%C2%A1Hola%20equipo%20GOZS!%20Quiero%20renovar%20mi%20cuota%20y%20te%20env%C3%ADo%20el%20comprobante%20de%20transferencia.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-12 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-border bg-card px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground hover:bg-secondary/60 touch-manipulation\">📲 Enviar comprobante por WhatsApp</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-150 select-none touch-manipulation focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer bg-transparent text-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 active:scale-[0.98] h-[var(--button-h)] px-3.5 text-sm min-h-11 w-full text-sm\" data-testid=\"expired-dismiss\">Entendido, seguir usando la app</button></div><div class=\"border-t border-border pt-3\"><p class=\"mb-2 text-center text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Entorno de Pruebas &amp; Auditoría QA:</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-150 select-none touch-manipulation focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer border bg-background text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-secondary/80 active:scale-[0.98] h-[var(--button-h-sm)] px-3 text-xs w-full text-xs\" data-testid=\"simulate-active-btn\">Simular Pago Confirmado (Cambiar a ACTIVE)</button></div></div></dialog><div class=\"space-y-5 pb-20\" data-testid=\"inicio-mis-dias-container\"><div class=\"pt-2\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground\">Hola, Lucía</p><h1 class=\"font-outfit text-2xl sm:text-[26px] font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground mt-0.5\">PLAN GENERAL</h1><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">Semana <span class=\"font-mono font-bold text-foreground\">3</span></p></div><div role=\"status\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-primary/40 bg-primary/10 hover:bg-primary/15 transition-all p-3.5 text-xs text-foreground cursor-pointer shadow-xs\" data-testid=\"unread-coach-message-banner\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-bold text-sm\">!</div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-primary\">Mensaje nuevo del Coach</span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-success-soft text-success border border-success-soft-border px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold\">No leído</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground truncate max-w-[200px] sm:max-w-md\">Totalmente de acuerdo con Félix. Si sentís molestia en el lumbar avísanos antes de subir kilos.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-primary/50 bg-primary/20 hover:bg-primary/30 text-primary transition-colors touch-manipulation min-h-8\">Ver mensaje</button></div><section aria-label=\"Día de hoy\" class=\"rounded-[20px] bg-[#0F172A] p-5 text-white shadow-xl border border-border\" data-testid=\"hero-dia-hoy\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-primary uppercase\">Te toca hoy</span><span data-testid=\"hero-superserie-badge\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-neutral-soft-border bg-neutral-soft px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-soft-foreground\">Circuito Violeta</span></div><h2 class=\"font-outfit text-[26px] sm:text-[28px] font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mt-1.5 leading-tight\">Día 1 · DÍA 1</h2><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground mt-1\"><span class=\"font-mono\">4</span> ejercicios · <span class=\"font-mono\">~37</span> min</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"mt-4 flex h-14 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[14px] bg-[#38BD